  "- 2副牌共108张，4人对战，对家组队：南(位置0)↔北(位置2)为A组队友，东(位置1)↔西(位置3)为B组队友": "- 2 decks, 108 cards, 4 players, partners sit opposite: South (0) ↔ North (2) form Team A; East (1) ↔ West (3) form Team B",
