  "- 规则：有三张时优先搭配对子组成三带二，有三带二就不能拆成三张+对子分两次出": "- Rule: when you have a triple, pair it with a pair as triple+pair; once formed, don't split it back into a triple and a pair",
  "- 核心原则：尽量降低出牌手数。27张牌，手数越少越容易抢到头游。每多一手牌就可能多给对手一次压制的机会": "- Core principle: minimize the number of plays. With 27 cards, fewer plays makes first out easier. Every extra play gives opponents another chance to suppress",
  "- 级牌大小介于小王和A之间：大王(17) > 小王(16) > 级牌(15) > A(14) > K(13) > ... > 2(2)": "- Level card strength: big joker (17) > small joker (16) > level card (15) > A (14) > K (13) > ... > 2 (2)",
