  "- 判断顺子时，把 J 读作 11、Q 读作 12、K 读作 13、A 读作 14，然后看是否为5个连续数字即可": "- For straights, read J=11, Q=12, K=13, A=14, then just check for 5 consecutive numbers",
  "- 其他牌型（顺子/钢板/连对/三带二/三张/对子/单张）：只能同类型比大小，不同类型不能互压": "- Other combinations (straight / consecutive triples / consecutive pairs / triple+pair / triple / pair / single): only the same type can be compared; different types cannot beat each other",
  "- 权衡原则：一切以配合队友获胜为目的，手数低 + 牌力强 + 灵活应变 = 最优组牌": "- Judgment principle: everything serves winning with your partner — low play count + strong cards + flexible adaptation = optimal arranging",
