  "- 三带二（5张1手）、钢板（6张1手）、顺子（5张1手）、连对（6张1手）等牌型一次能出多张，有效减少手数": "- Triple+pair (5 cards, 1 play), consecutive triples (6, 1 play), straight (5, 1 play), consecutive pairs (6, 1 play) — these play many cards at once and effectively cut down play counts",
  "- 三张比三张的点数；对子比对子的点数；单张比单张的点数": "- Triple beats triple by rank; pair beats pair by rank; single beats single by rank",
