  "- 天王炸 > 6张及以上炸弹 > 同花顺 > 5张炸弹 > 4张炸弹 > 其他牌型": "- King bomb > bombs of 6+ cards > straight flush > 5-card bomb > 4-card bomb > other combinations",
  "- 同花顺 vs 炸弹：同花顺算5张档，高于4张炸弹，低于6张及以上炸弹": "- Straight flush vs bomb: a straight flush counts as 5 cards — beats a 4-card bomb, loses to bombs of 6+ cards",
  "- 同类型比点数：顺子/连对/钢板比最大那张牌的点数；三带二只比三张的点数（对子不参与比较），三张同点则不能压": "- Same type compares rank: straights / consecutive pairs / consecutive triples compare their highest card; triple+pair compares only the triple (the pair is not compared); equal triples cannot beat each other",
