  "- 用炸弹清场 = 当对手出了牌压制了你队友时，你用更大的炸弹反压对手，让队友重新获得出牌权": "- Clearing with a bomb = when an opponent's play suppresses your partner, you re-beat with a bigger bomb so your partner regains the lead",
