  "- 总之：能组成更大牌型的，必须组成大牌型而非拆成小牌型。组牌时从大往小看：钢板 → 连对 → 三带二 → 顺子 → 三张 → 对子": "- In short: form the biggest combinations possible instead of splitting into smaller ones. When arranging, work from big to small: consecutive triples → consecutive pairs → triple+pair → straight → triple → pair",
