  "- pile_cards 的 groups 参数是对手牌索引的一次完整分区，各组索引必须互不重叠。每张牌最多归入一组，其余牌为散牌。这不是候选方案列表，不能把同一张牌放在多个组里": "- pile_cards' groups argument is one complete partition of your hand indices: groups must not overlap, each card belongs to at most one group, the rest stay loose. It is not a list of candidate options — a card cannot appear in multiple groups",
