  "1. 单张：任意1张": "1. Single: any 1 card",
  "1. 自己能否直接出完（头游）？→ 出牌冲刺": "1. Can you finish outright (1st out)? → play to win now",
  "1. 组牌思路：是否因为组牌策略不对，导致某手牌迟迟打不出去？比如把本该拆开跟牌的牌硬组成了大牌型，或者把本该保留的炸弹拆散了？应该以什么为优先——是优先组顺子/连对以便跟牌，还是优先保留炸弹/大牌型以便压牌？": "1. Arranging: did a wrong arranging strategy leave some plays stuck in hand? E.g. forcing big combinations that should have been split for following, or breaking up bombs that should have been kept? What should take priority — building straights/consecutive pairs for following, or keeping bombs/big combinations for suppression?",
  "10. 天王炸：2大王+2小王，全场最大": "10. King bomb: 2 big jokers + 2 small jokers — the strongest in the game",
  "108 张": "108 cards",
  "2 大王 + 2 小王，全场最大": "2 big jokers + 2 small jokers — the absolute strongest",
  "2 组连续三张": "2 consecutive triples",
  "2. 出牌节奏：自己和队友是否出现「牌出不去」的情况——手里有能打的牌但因为组牌方式导致没有合适的牌型去跟？队友是否因为你的出牌选择（比如过早打出大牌、没有及时喂牌）而陷入被动？": "2. Rhythm: did you or your partner get stuck with playable cards but no suitable combination because of how the hand was arranged? Did your choices (playing big cards too early, not feeding the partner in time) leave your partner passive?",
  "2. 对手是否即将头游？→ 不惜代价压制": "2. Is an opponent about to finish? → suppress at any cost",
  "2. 对子：同点2张（含对大王/对小王）": "2. Pair: 2 cards of the same rank (incl. big joker pair / small joker pair)",
  "27 张": "27 cards",
  "3 对连续（含 QQKKAA）": "3 consecutive pairs (incl. QQKKAA)",
  "3. 博弈判断：在关键轮次中，选择「压牌抢出牌权」还是「放牌让队友接」的判断准则是什么？考虑当前局势（是否头游在望、对手剩余牌数）时，决策有什么可以改进的地方？": "3. Judgment: in critical rounds, what's your criterion for \"beat to seize the lead\" vs. \"let go so the partner takes over\"? Given the situation (first out in sight? opponents' remaining cards?), how could decisions improve?",
  "3. 队友是否领出或即将头游？→ 过牌让队友走": "3. Is your partner leading or about to finish? → pass and let them play",
  "3. 三张：同点3张": "3. Triple: 3 cards of the same rank",
  "4 张及以上同点": "4+ cards of the same rank",
  "4. 逢人配使用：逢人配（红心级牌）有没有被浪费在低价值的牌型上？应该优先用来凑炸弹还是凑同花顺？在什么情况下应该保留逢人配而不是急于用掉？": "4. Wild card usage: was the wild card wasted on low-value combinations? Should it have built a bomb or a straight flush? When should it be kept instead of spent?",
  "4. 跟牌代价是否合理？→ 代价小就跟，代价大就过": "4. Is following reasonable? → cheap to follow, pass if too costly",
  "4. 三带二：同点3张 + 一个对子（对子点数必须与三张不同。如 999+QQ 合法，不能是 999+99）": "4. Triple+pair: a triple plus a pair (the pair's rank must differ from the triple's; e.g. 999+QQ is legal, 999+99 is not)",
  "5 张连续（含 10JQKA、A2345）": "5 consecutive cards (incl. 10JQKA, A2345)",
  "5. 都没有特殊情况的普通轮次 → 正常应对": "5. No special situation → respond normally",
  "5. 顺子：5张连续单张（不限花色）。即5张牌的底层数字依次递增1。包括 10JQKA（10~14）和 A2345（A视为1，1~5）。普通级牌（非红心）按本身数字(15)参与连续；逢人配（红心级牌）可替代任意数字凑连续": "5. Straight: 5 consecutive singles (suits don't matter), i.e. the base numbers increase by 1 each step, including 10JQKA (10-14) and A2345 (A=1, 1-5). A regular level card (non-heart) counts as 15 in the sequence; a wild card (heart level card) substitutes any number",
  "6. 连对：3对连续对子（不限花色）。即3个对子的点数数字依次递增1。包括 QQKKAA（12~14）和 AA2233（A视为1，1~3）。普通级牌（非红心）按本身数字(15)参与连续；逢人配（红心级牌）可替代任意数字凑连续": "6. Consecutive pairs: 3 consecutive pairs (suits don't matter), i.e. pair ranks increase by 1 each step, including QQKKAA (12-14) and AA2233 (A=1, 1-3). A regular level card (non-heart) counts as 15 in the sequence; a wild card substitutes any number",
  "7. 钢板：2个连续三同张（不限花色，如333444）。普通级牌（非红心）按本身数字(15)参与连续；逢人配（红心级牌）可替代任意数字凑连续": "7. Consecutive triples: 2 consecutive triples (suits don't matter, e.g. 333444). A regular level card (non-heart) counts as 15 in the sequence; a wild card substitutes any number",
  "8. 炸弹：4张及以上同点，张数越多越大": "8. Bomb: 4+ cards of the same rank; more cards = bigger bomb",
  "9. 同花顺：同花色连续5张。即5张同花色牌的底层数字依次递增1。包括 10JQKA（10~14）和 A2345（A视为1，1~5）。普通级牌（非红心）按本身数字(15)参与连续；逢人配（红心级牌）可替代任意数字且花色可任意适配凑连续": "9. Straight flush: 5 consecutive cards of the same suit, base numbers increasing by 1, including 10JQKA (10-14) and A2345 (A=1, 1-5). A regular level card (non-heart) counts as 15; a wild card substitutes any number and adapts to any suit",
  "把不同模型换上桌：同一个牌桌、同一副牌、同一套规则，风格打法高下立判。每个决策全程可见，不是黑箱；经验记忆随时可清空，保证各家公平起跑。战绩自动入账——打一晚上，谁的胜率最高，一目了然。": "Swap models onto the table: same table, same deck, same rules — styles and skill stand revealed. Every decision is visible, no black box; experience memory can be cleared anytime for a fair start. Stats are recorded automatically — play a night and the best win rate speaks for itself.",
  "保存": "Save",
