  "不要": "Pass",
  "不要记录「第X轮我出了XXX，队友出了XXX」这类具体细节。要从整局博弈中提炼出可迁移的打牌原则和博弈规律。": "Don't record specifics like \"in round X I played XXX, my partner played XXX.\" Extract transferable principles and patterns from the whole game.",
  "不用服务器、不写训练脚本，就在这台电脑上。锁住一个模型，一局局陪它打：每局结束自动复盘、把得失提炼成经验，越打越有牌感——练久了，它就成了一位只属于你的牌神 agent。": "No server, no training scripts — right on this machine. Lock in one model and play game after game: each game ends with an auto-review that distills wins and losses into experience. The more you play, the sharper it gets — keep at it and it becomes a card-god agent that's all yours.",
  "不用注册账号、不用上传任何东西。你填的模型 Key、AI 的记忆、每一局战绩，都只保存在这台设备的浏览器缓存中——随时可查，随时可删。": "No sign-up, nothing uploaded. Your model Keys, AI memory, and every game's stats live only in this device's browser storage — viewable and deletable anytime.",
  "部分索引无效。手牌共{n}张(索引0-{m})。你提供的索引对应的牌: [{list}]。请先调用 view_hand 重新确认。": "Some indices are invalid. Hand has {n} cards (indices 0-{m}). Cards at your provided indices: [{list}]. Call view_hand to re-confirm first.",
  "参赛阵容": "The lineup",
  "查看 AI 对话过程": "View AI conversation",
  "查看本局所有轮的出牌历史。返回每一轮各家出牌情况（牌型、点数、power），帮助判断哪些大牌和炸弹已经出过。在任何时候都可以调用，不消耗回合。": "View this game's play history by round. Returns each round's plays (combination, rank, power) to help judge which big cards and bombs are gone. Callable anytime; doesn't consume a turn.",
  "查看当前手牌。返回排序后的手牌列表（含索引）、已有牌摞、级牌和逢人配信息。在调用其他工具之前必须先调用此工具获取当前手牌索引。每次理牌或拆牌后手牌索引不变，但牌摞状态会更新。": "View your current hand. Returns the sorted hand list (with indices), existing piles, level card and wild card info. Must be called before any other tool to get current indices. Indices stay stable after arranging/splitting, but pile state updates.",
  "拆牌": "Split",
  "拆牌：将一个或多个牌摞拆散，牌回到手牌中。传入牌摞编号（piles），编号来自 view_hand 中显示的「牌摞N」。支持单个牌摞或批量拆散多个牌摞。": "Split: break one or more piles back into your hand. Pass pile numbers (piles) from view_hand's \"Pile N\" list. Supports one pile or several at once.",
  "出牌": "Play",
  "出牌：从手牌中选择索引出牌（最终动作，调用后回合结束）。牌型必须合法，且必须能压过场上牌（除非你是领出者）。调用此工具后你的回合立即结束。": "Play: play cards by index (final action — ends your turn). The combination must be legal and must beat the table (unless you are the lead). Your turn ends immediately after this call.",
  "出牌成功后仍有{n}张牌留在手牌中": "{n} cards still remain in hand after a successful play",
