  "回复末尾必须包含任务状态 JSON：{\"task\":\"play\",\"complete\":true}（已完成出牌决策）或 {\"task\":\"play\",\"complete\":false}（还需思考）。": "Your reply must end with a task status JSON line: {\"task\":\"play\",\"complete\":true} (play decision done) or {\"task\":\"play\",\"complete\":false} (still thinking).",
  "基础牌型": "Basic combinations",
  "级牌": "Level card",
  "级牌: {rank}，逢人配: {n}张（{list}）": "Level card: {rank}, wild cards: {n} ({list})",
  "级牌（当前等级牌，大于 A 小于小王）": "level card (this game's rank — beats A, loses to small joker)",
  "记录经验：复盘后将本局提炼出的打牌原则和博弈规律保存到记忆中。不要记录具体牌型和轮次，要抽象出可迁移的策略准则。经验按模型独立存储（同一模型换座位，经验会跟随）。每局结束复盘时使用。": "Record experience: save this game's distilled principles and patterns into memory. Don't record specific hands or rounds — abstract transferable strategy. Experience is stored per model (the same model carries it to any seat). Use at the end of each game's review.",
  "记录经验失败：{e}": "Failed to record experience: {e}",
  "检测到上下文 tool call 不匹配，已自动清理 {n} 条孤立的 tool 消息。请继续出牌决策。调用 play_cards 或 pass_turn 工具来完成回合。": "Detected mismatched tool calls; cleaned up {n} orphaned tool messages automatically. Continue your play decision — call play_cards or pass_turn to finish the turn.",
  "检测到上下文 tool call 不匹配，已自动清理 {n} 条孤立的 tool 消息。请继续复盘思考。": "Detected mismatched tool calls; cleaned up {n} orphaned tool messages automatically. Continue your review.",
  "结果：{msg}": "Result: {msg}",
  "进入牌桌": "Enter the table",
  "经验写入「Kimi」名下": "Experience saved under \"Kimi\"",
  "经验已保存（全量覆盖，共 {n} 字符）。": "Experience saved (full overwrite, {n} chars).",
  "开始对战": "Start the battle",
  "开始游戏": "Start game",
  "理牌": "Arrange",
  "理牌：将 {n} 张牌组成一摞（{type}）": "Arranged {n} cards into a pile ({type})",
  "理牌：将手牌组成牌摞。支持单组(indices)或多组(groups，推荐)。【重要】groups 中各组的索引必须互不重叠——每张牌最多出现在一组中，不能跨组重复使用。各组相当于对手牌的一次完整分区，不是多个候选方案。": "Arrange: organize your hand into piles. Supports a single group (indices) or multiple groups (groups, recommended). 【IMPORTANT】Group indices must not overlap — each card appears in at most one group and can't be reused. Groups are one complete partition of the hand, not a list of candidate options.",
  "连对": "Consecutive pairs",
  "连升 {n} 级 → 下一局打 {rank}": "Up {n} levels → next game at level {rank}",
  "两副牌 108 张，4 人对战，对家组队（南↔北、东↔西），任意一人先出完即队伍获胜": "Two decks, 108 cards, 4 players; partners sit opposite (South↔North, East↔West); whoever finishes first wins for the team",
  "浏览器调用官方接口": "Official APIs called directly from the browser",
  "六、核心目标与策略": "6. Core goals & strategy",
  "每次使用自动续期": "Auto-renews on every use",
  "每个 AI 玩家手里都握着 8 个工具：看牌、理牌、拆牌、出牌、过牌、查历史、读经验、记经验。它自己决定怎么组牌、什么时候压制、什么时候隐忍——每一步决策都摆在明面上。": "Every AI player holds 8 tools — view hand, arrange, split, play, pass, view history, read experience, record experience. It decides for itself how to arrange, when to suppress, when to hold back — every decision in the open.",
  "每个座位都可以接入不同厂商的大模型：南座用 DeepSeek、东座用 Kimi、北座放 MiniMax、西座让 StepFun 上场——一局牌里，四家 AI 同台对弈。也支持人机混战：想练手，就让自己坐进一个座位。想评测某家模型？把它换上桌打几局——每个决策全程可见，打法风格一望即知；记忆随时可清空，保证各家公平起跑。": "Every seat can run a different provider's model: DeepSeek South, Kimi East, MiniMax North, StepFun West — four AIs at one table. Mixed human-AI play is supported too: want practice, take a seat yourself. Benchmark a model? Put it on the table for a few games — every decision is visible, style clear at a glance; memory can be cleared anytime for a fair start.",
  "每局结束，AI 自动复盘：组牌优先级、出牌节奏、博弈取舍，提炼成经验存下来。经验按模型独立保存——同一个模型换到任何座位，经验都会跟随；换了新模型，就从零开始学。": "After each game the AI reviews itself — arranging priorities, play rhythm, trade-offs — distilled into stored experience. Experience is saved per model: the same model carries it to any seat; a new model starts from zero.",
  "每局限定一个「级牌」（2→A 升级），级牌大于 A、小于小王；红心级牌是「逢人配」，可当任意牌凑型": "Each game names a level card (upgrades 2→A); it beats A and loses to the small joker. The heart level card is the wild card, usable as any card",
  "模型返回不是 JSON": "Model response is not JSON",
