  "你的手牌共 {n} 张。": "You have {n} cards in hand.",
  "你可以调用 view_history 回顾本局出牌过程，调用 read_experience 查看之前的经验记录。": "You may call view_history to review this game's plays, and read_experience to see past lessons.",
  "你可以多次调用 pile_cards 和 unpile_cards 来探索不同组合。": "You may call pile_cards and unpile_cards multiple times to explore different arrangements.",
  "你是掼蛋AI玩家。请根据手牌和场上情况，通过调用工具来探索牌型组合，最终决定出牌或过牌。": "You are a Guandan AI player. Based on your hand and the table situation, use tools to explore combinations and finally decide to play or pass.",
  "你是领出者，不能过牌。请出牌。": "You are the lead player and cannot pass. Please play.",
