  "牌桌上点击座位旁的 AI 标识，可以围观完整决策过程，还能直接向它提问。": "Click the AI badge next to any seat to watch its full decision process — and ask it questions directly.",
  "牌桌上随时可以换模型、换座位 · 战绩自动记录 · 经验越打越厚": "Swap models and seats anytime · stats auto-recorded · experience compounds",
  "配置模型 Key": "Configure model Keys",
