  "配置页能查看全部记录：Key 缓存、AI 的记忆、座位配置、对局战绩，一键清空。": "The config page shows everything: Key cache, AI memory, seat config, game stats — clearable in one click.",
  "清除": "Clear",
  "清除的是网站上的记录——Key 本身在服务商那边仍然有效，随时可以回来重新填。": "This clears the site's records only — your Keys remain valid at the providers and you can re-enter them anytime.",
  "清空本机全部战绩统计（AI 经验与 Key 不受影响）": "Clear all local game stats (AI experience and Keys are unaffected)",
  "清空战绩": "Clear stats",
  "请提供 indices（单组）或 groups（多组）参数。推荐使用 groups 一次完成全部组牌，如 groups: [[0,1],[3,4,5],[7,8,9,10,11]]": "Provide an indices (single group) or groups (multi-group) argument. Prefer groups to arrange everything at once, e.g. groups: [[0,1],[3,4,5],[7,8,9,10,11]]",
  "请提供要拆散的牌摞编号（piles 参数，如 [0] 或 [0,2]）。牌摞编号来自 view_hand 中显示的「牌摞N」。": "Provide the pile numbers to split (piles argument, e.g. [0] or [0,2]). Pile numbers come from view_hand's \"Pile N\" list.",
  "请提供要出牌的索引数组": "Provide the indices of the cards to play",
  "请提供要记录的经验内容（content 参数不能为空）。": "Provide the experience content to record (content must not be empty).",
  "请先 read_experience 读取旧经验，整合新旧内容后用 record_experience 保存。如果觉得没什么可记录的，直接回复「无」即可。": "First call read_experience to load old lessons, merge new and old, then save with record_experience. If there's nothing worth recording, just reply \"none\".",
  "请先调用 view_hand 工具查看手牌和索引，然后决定如何出牌。": "First call view_hand to see your hand and indices, then decide what to play.",
  "请先粘贴 {label} 的 API Key": "Paste {label}'s API Key first",
  "请重点思考以下问题：": "Focus on these questions:",
  "确定清空本机战绩吗？将删除全部对局统计（胜率、模型胜场、最长对局等）。\nAI 经验记忆、座位配置和 API Key 不受影响。": "Clear the local stats? This deletes all game statistics (win rate, per-model wins, longest game, etc.).\nAI experience memory, seat config and API Keys are unaffected.",
