  "随时可查可删": "Viewable and deletable anytime",
  "所选牌 [{cards}] 无法组成合法牌型。可能原因: 1) 索引过时(手牌排序在理牌/出牌后可能变化) 2) 牌型不合法。请先调用 view_hand 重新确认索引。": "The selected cards [{cards}] don't form a legal combination. Possible causes: 1) stale indices (hand order may change after arranging/playing) 2) illegal combination. Call view_hand to re-confirm the indices.",
