  "所选牌型打不过上家的牌，请重新选择或过牌": "Your combination can't beat the previous play — select again or pass",
  "索引 {idx} 超出范围（当前手牌共 {n} 张，有效索引 0~{m}）": "Index {idx} out of range (hand has {n} cards, valid indices 0~{m})",
  "索引 {idx} 同时出现在第{a}组和第{b}组中。groups 各组索引必须互不重叠——每张牌只能归入一组。请重新规划，确保各组的索引完全不重复。": "Index {idx} appears in both group {a} and group {b}. Groups must not overlap — each card belongs to exactly one group. Re-plan so no index repeats.",
