  "已过期，建议 <b>续期</b> 或重新保存": "Expired — <b>renew</b> or re-save recommended",
  "以推理见长 · 善于计算": "Strong reasoning · great at calculation",
  "隐藏": "Hide",
  "游戏结束 - {team}胜（升{n}级 → 打{rank}）": "Game over — {team} wins (up {n} levels → level {rank})",
  "游戏中": "In game",
  "越打越有牌感，换座位也不丢": "Gets sharper with every game; follows the model to any seat",
  "再来一局": "Play again",
  "暂无操作日志": "No decision log yet",
  "炸弹": "Bomb",
  "长上下文旗舰 · 调度从容": "Long-context flagship · composed orchestration",
  "这个项目，能拿来干什么": "What can you do with it?",
  "这里是属于大模型的牌桌：每位 AI 都是会用工具的 Agent——自己看牌、自己理牌、自己出牌，每局打完还会复盘、沉淀经验。座位随意换模型，真人也能上场，一桌之内，人机混战。这张桌既能评测各家模型的牌技，也能一局局养成只属于你的牌神。": "This is a table built for LLMs: every AI is a tool-using agent — reads its own hand, arranges its own cards, plays its own plays, and reviews each game to accumulate experience. Seats can swap models freely, humans can sit in — one table, humans and AIs mixed. The table both benchmarks each model's skill and raises a card-god that's yours alone.",
  "只属于这台浏览器的战报——赢了算你的，输了怪模型。": "A scoreboard that belongs to this browser — win, take the credit; lose, blame the model.",
  "只要还在用它，记录就会自动重新续满 30 天，不会打到一半突然失效。": "As long as you keep using it, the record renews back to 30 days — it won't expire mid-game.",
  "至少配一家服务商，游戏就能跑：四个 AI 座位会自动从已配置的模型中挑选。想细调的话，也可以到游戏页给每个座位单独指定不同的服务商与模型 —— 比如让 DeepSeek 和 Kimi 对打。Key 只存在浏览器缓存里 —— 30 天不用，网站上的记录就自动清除；每次使用或打开页面，记录都会自动续满 30 天。": "Configure at least one provider and the game runs: the four AI seats auto-pick from configured models. Want finer control? Head to the game page and give each seat its own provider and model — e.g. let DeepSeek face Kimi. Keys live only in browser cache — 30 days unused and the site's record clears automatically; every use or page load renews it back to 30 days.",
  "至少配一家即可开局：没单独指定的座位会自动用已配置的模型（默认取第一家已配置的默认模型）；想给每个座位配不同模型，到游戏页的「座位配置」里各自选择即可。Key 只存在浏览器缓存里，30 天不使用，网站上的 Key 记录就自动清除；每次使用记录都会自动续满 30 天。以下均为官方站点。": "Configure at least one provider to start: seats without a specific assignment auto-use a configured model (defaults to the first configured provider's default model); to give each seat a different model, pick them in the game page's \"Seat config\". Keys live only in browser cache — 30 days unused and the site's Key record clears automatically; every use renews it back to 30 days. The links below are all official sites.",
